*** Settings ***
Documentation       Automatic test for example_hal_crc_user_defined_polynomial.
...                 This test suite is verifying that the application binary runs without error,
...                 according to the README documentation.

Library             robot_for_stm32
Library             robot_for_stm32.STM32CubeProgrammer
Library             robot_for_stm32.Console
Variables           robot_for_stm32.cube_examples_constants

Test Setup          Default Setup    ${TEST_CONFIG_FILE}
Test Teardown       Default Cleanup

Test Tags           ip:hal_crc    profile:printf


*** Test Cases ***
${TEST_ID} Scenario adherence
    [Documentation]    This test checks that the application binary runs according to
    ...    the scenario described in the README.
    Example Step 1
    Example Step 2
    Example Step 3


*** Keywords ***
Example Step 1
    [Documentation]    The CRC is initialized
    ...    Checks that initialization (app_init) runs without error
    Read Console Until    [INFO] Step 1: Device initialization COMPLETED.
    Comment    ExecStatus value is then EXEC_STATUS_INIT_OK
    ...    but becomes immediately EXEC_STATUS_OK as there is no delay after.

Example Step 2
    [Documentation]    the CRC is calculated for a 32-bits data words buffer and compared to the expected result.
    Read Console Until    [INFO] Step 2: Correct CRC value (0x98)
    Check Integer Variable    CrcValue    0x98    timeout=1s

Example Step 3
    [Documentation]    The CRC peripheral is de-initialized.
    Read Console Until    [INFO] Step 3: de-init
    Check Integer Variable    ExecStatus    ${EXEC_STATUS_OK}
